 107:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/sw/blend/lv_draw_sw_blend_private.h ****  * grow and a whole pixel can be mixed with one multiplication.
 108:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/sw/blend/lv_draw_sw_blend_private.h ****  * See https://stackoverflow.com/a/50012418/1999969
